Right. They use real academic grounding.

02:59.420 --> 03:04.820
Exactly. The essay starts by analyzing a specific working paper published by a team of four

03:04.820 --> 03:10.980
researchers. That's Miller, Veldoron, Leighton, and Yampolsky. And they wrote about this concept

03:10.980 --> 03:12.640
