events in time and space. A person is alive or a person is deceased.

04:38.500 --> 04:39.300
There's a certificate.

04:39.720 --> 04:41.220
There's a biological cessation.

04:41.220 --> 04:47.680
Exactly. That makes mortality incredibly easy to audit, to record in a database, and to build

