an optimization metric around. But suffering? Suffering is continuous. It is highly subjective.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.900
It is deeply private.

04:57.620 --> 05:02.180
You can't just put a thermometer in someone's ear and get a perfect, undeniable readout of

05:02.180 --> 05:03.440
their existential dread.

